Brazil TV is an unofficial customization of webOS IPTV Player 1.17.0.
Original project and source: https://github.com/lennylxx/webos-iptv-player
Original license: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Customizations by Djyms, 2026: Brazil TV artwork, scoped HLS playback policy,
public-player source resolution, uploaded-playlist startup recovery and webOS
settings layout correction. Reproducible transformations are in patch-player.cjs,
stream-resolvers.js, settings-fix.css and build.mjs.

hls.js 1.6.16 by video-dev / Dailymotion is downloaded with a pinned hash.
Its Apache 2.0 license is retained inside the generated app. All original
third-party notices and license files are preserved in the package.

Stream links were curated from iptv-org/iptv, Free-TV/IPTV and iptv-com/iptv,
with public broadcast-player endpoints for selected channels. See sources.json.
Channel content, names and logos belong to their respective owners. This
repository does not host or grant rights to broadcast content and has no
affiliation with LG, broadcasters, streaming platforms or the original author.
